X86: bound native MSVC inlining of the legacy scan decoder

MSVC 19.52 runs out of compiler heap while building the generated legacy
terminal at /O2 /Ob2. Keep a single copy of that switch on this compiler
and preserve the existing inline policy on the other supported compilers.
